# compression-timeout-watch
owner: looker · cadence: human phrase · status: SUGGESTED
**Watch Hermes compression timeout errors and correlate them to active model/provider state.**

## Prompt
Collect recent Hermes compression-timeout errors, note active model/provider, and report whether fallback to local main or local aux would fix the next one.

## Evidence
> Context compression timed out before it could commit while the request was still approximately 387,009 tokens
> Restart Hermes and the compression timeouts stop — context compression now routes through Maple locally
